<%# FUIME: no personal greeting — this goes to every manager on the venture,
    which for two co-founders is two people. Sibling of approved.html.erb for
    a venture coming back from a suspension; see Fuime::VettingMailer for why
    the two are separate. %>
<p>
  Hello,
</p>

<p>
  Fuime has lifted the suspension on <strong><%= @event.name %></strong>. It's approved to sell again.
  <% if @can_publish && @published_offers %>
    Your published offers are back on sale.
  <% elsif @can_publish %>
    You can publish an offer now.
  <% else %>
    Your <em>What you sell</em> page lists anything that still needs sorting
    before you can sell.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Go to what you sell", @offers_url,
              style: "display:inline-block;background:#2242FF;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="word-break: break-all;">
  Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <%= link_to @offers_url, @offers_url %>
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or write to <%= @support_email %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The Fuime team
</p>
